<title>USA: CoreStates Financial Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>CoreStates Financial Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.94		    $0.81</p>
<p> Net			198,113		  177,144</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 211,276		  219,512</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is CoreStates Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Excluding restructuring and merger-related charges, Q1 1996 net income was $190.9 million, or $0.87 per share.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.96.</p>
</text>
